# ASUS Info Hub <-> ROG Ryuo IV screen, captured with `adb logcat` on the
# cooler while genuine Info Hub drove it. Primary evidence for PROTOCOL.md.
#
# SANITISED: the capturing host's CPU/GPU model strings, RAM size and disk
# size have been replaced with placeholders. Everything structural -- field
# names, nesting, types, units, ordering, timing -- is exactly as captured.
#
# The three VideoLog lines with garbled text are the launcher's Chinese debug
# strings mangled by the Windows console (cp850). Decoded they read
# "释放资源:<id>" (release resources) and
# "main_video1.视频准备完毕,可以进行播放:false" (video prepared, can play: false).
# Left as captured.
#
C:\>adb logcat -s HomeUI:* MsgReceiverManager:* *:D | findstr /I "STATE_POST screenConfigChange refreshShowData VideoLog"
